Opt-in whole-array Metal compute storage views. Layer zero binds every array
slice at the selected mip; nonzero layers bind an ordinary 2D slice. Separate
readonly array aliases preserve sampled 2D/cube views. Existing retained
texture ownership and Metal hazard tracking cover pass transitions and cycling.

diff --git a/src/gpu/metal/SDL_gpu_metal.m b/src/gpu/metal/SDL_gpu_metal.m
